<title>USA: Delphi Financial sets 20 pct stock payout.</title>
<headline>Delphi Financial sets 20 pct stock payout.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delphi Financial Group Inc said Tuesday directors declared a special 20 percent stock dividend, payable on September 30 to stockholders of record on September 16.</p>
<p>Delphi also said it intends to list its Class A Common on the New York Stock Exchange as early as during the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it has been cleared by the New York Stock Exchange to submit an application for listing.  The stock nowq trades on the Nasdaq system.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
